                        </svg>
                        Methodology & Standards
                    </h4>
                    <div class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700">
                        <p><strong>Scope 1 Emissions:</strong> Direct emissions from company-owned vehicles, generators, and production processes. Calculated using fuel consumption data and emission factors from IPCC 2006 Guidelines.</p>
                        <p><strong>Scope 2 Emissions:</strong> Indirect emissions from purchased electricity. Calculated using location-based method with emission factors from PLN (Indonesia's State Electricity Company) for 2024.</p>
                        <p><strong>Gases Included:</strong> CO₂, CH₄, N₂O, and HFCs. All emissions are reported in CO₂ equivalent using GWP values from IPCC Fifth Assessment Report (AR5).</p>
                        <p><strong>Standards Applied:</strong> GHG Protocol Corporate Accounting and Reporting Standard, ISO 14064-1:2018</p>
                        <p><strong>Base Year:</strong> 2019 was selected as base year due to stable operations and comprehensive data availability. No significant structural changes have occurred that would require base year recalculation.</p>
                    </div>
